  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nExpression = [(0.36)² - (0.04)²] ÷ 1.6\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\na² - b² = (a - b) × (a + b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ [(0.36)² - (0.04)²] = (0.36 - 0.04) × (0.36 + 0.04)\n\n⇒ = 0.32 × 0.40\n\n⇒ = 0.128\n\n⇒ 0.128 ÷ 1.6\n\n⇒ = 0.08\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 0.08.**",
